{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/init()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"init()","symbolKind":"init","roleHeading":"Initializer","externalID":"s:5Swami20Interaction_DragViewVACycfc","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/init()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","title":"Interaction_DragView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/init()":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"init()","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/init()","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/init()","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection"}}}